<title>TURKEY: Turkey's TUPRAS raises petrol prices.</title>
<headline>Turkey's TUPRAS raises petrol prices.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish oil refiner TUPRAS is to raise the price of petroleum products by seven percent, the company said in a statement on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said the increase, to take effect on Sunday, was due to the continuing fall of the Turkish lira against the dollar.</p>
</text>
